"""minecellweb: a small web front end for minecell.

Pick a version, log in or set a name, launch the game. A launch is either a regular one (the game opens on this
machine's own display) or a browser one: this server stops, KasmVNC's Xvnc is started as this user (no service, no
desktop, nothing but the game) on the same address, the game runs fullscreen in it and you play it in the browser
with mouse lock; when the game exits the normal page is back.

minecell is looked up in the current directory, then in PATH, and downloaded if neither has it.
"""
